Package: confluencia
Title: R Bridge to Confluencia circRNA Drug Discovery Platform
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("IGEM-FBH", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "igem@fbh-china.org")
Description: Provides R bindings to the Confluencia platform for circRNA
    therapeutic evaluation. Includes PK simulation (CTM/RNA-CTM),
    immunogenicity prediction, MHC encoding, and 5D joint evaluation
    via reticulate bridge to the Python backend.
